        "cooked": "<p>Yes twists can happen by NPCs doing overcomes.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Minions if you say have 3 you roll a d6 three times one for each mook and then their done. Liuetenants are mini bosses and keep to themselves really.</p>\n<p>Yes to all of that.</p>\n<p>Each Villain has a unique mechanic to determine status die.</p>\n<p>Yes</p>\n<p>Yes</p>",
